---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Mohammed Fawaz — About">
  <header class="masthead">
    <h1>MOHAMMED FAWAZ</h1>
    <p>Robotics and Automation Engineering</p>
  </header>

  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h2 id="about-heading">About Me</h2>
    <p>I am Mohammed Fawaz, a Robotics and Automation Engineering undergraduate who enjoys understanding how machines work and finding ways to make them work better. I am drawn to engineering because it gives me the opportunity to turn an idea into something I can build, test, and improve.</p>
    <p>My strengths are mechanical design and bringing hardware and software together. I enjoy working through practical problems, whether that means revising a design, finding the cause of a fault, or helping a team get a prototype working. Building and testing systems has taught me to pay attention to the small details that affect the result.</p>
    <p>I am particularly interested in robotics and automation that make everyday work easier and more reliable. I want to develop as an engineer in a team where I can contribute to real products, learn from experienced people, and take on greater responsibility as my skills grow.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="education-heading">
    <h2 id="education-heading">Education</h2>
    <p><strong>Bachelor of Engineering in Robotics &amp; Automation</strong><br />Sahyadri College of Engineering and Management<br />August 2022 – October 2026 (expected)<br />Cumulative GPA: 3.5/4</p>
  </section>


  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <h2 id="contact-heading">Contact</h2>
    <p><a class="project-link" href="mailto:mohammedfawaz4795@gmail.com">mohammedfawaz4795@gmail.com</a><br />
    <a class="project-link" href="tel:+971504198176">+971 50 419 8176</a><br />
    <a class="project-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammed-fawaz-4795f" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><br />
    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/Fawaz4795" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .masthead { border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .masthead h1 { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1.8rem; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .masthead p { margin: 0; color: var(--line); }
  .about { border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .about p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .about p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .project-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--line-bright); text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .project-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .project-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
